sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Cliente A
    participant S as Servidor
    participant B as Cliente B
    A--xS: conexão cai
    S->>B: OPPONENT_DISCONNECTED (grace_seconds)
    Note over S: turno suspenso por até 30 s
    alt A volta dentro do prazo
        A->>S: AUTH (token)
        S-->>A: AUTH_OK (active_match_id)
        S->>B: OPPONENT_RECONNECTED
        Note over S: turno reiniciado
        A->>S: MATCH_SYNC (match_id)
        S-->>A: MATCH_STATE (you_are, opponent)
    else prazo esgotado
        S->>B: MATCH_ENDED (WIN, DISCONNECT)
    end
